Chapter: CtorTypeCollision
  cites Codex chapter General

 A parametric variant whose constructor shares the type name now
 compiles and runs correctly. It previously silently miscompiled to an
 invalid-opcode (#UD) crash at construction, because the codegen type
 table was the value env and the constructor's function type clobbered
 the type's SumTy. The emit table now merges the type-only bindings and
 lookup-type-binding prefers a Sum/Record type over a same-named ctor.

Section: X

  Box (a) =
    | Box (a)

  unbox : Box Integer -> Integer
  unbox (b) = when b
    is Box (v) -> v

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (unbox (Box 42)))
  end

